<div class="text pt-15 aem-GridColumn--default--none aem-GridColumn--phone--none aem-GridColumn--phone--12 aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--offset--phone--0 aem-GridColumn--offset--default--0 aem-GridColumn--default--4"><div class="cmp-text">
    <h4>SWIFT AV Base Potential Erroneous Low Battery Warning</h4>
<p>Certain System Sensor SWIFT AV bases have the potential to generate a premature and erroneous low battery notification. This notification is not a safety issue, but low battery warnings should be addressed promptly to avoid potential problems with system operations which may arise.</p>

</div>

    
</div>
